== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added 5 new [[Greed machine]] unlocks.
* Added {{i|Mega Blast}} item.
* Added {{t|Store Key}} trinket.
* Added pop-up text whenever Isaac activates a new [[transformation]].

=== Changes ===
* Decreased HP:
** [[Ultra Greed]]'s blank coin 100 → 50.
** Ultra Greed's key coin 100 → 60.
** Ultra Greed's bomb coin 100 → 50.
** Ultra Greed's heart coin 100 → 40.
* Increased [[Azazel]]'s damage and decreased charge time.
* {{i|Head of Krampus}} lasers now have a chance to rotate.
* Increased Isaac's speed in [[The Guardian]] and [[SPEED!]] challenges.
* Decreased intensity of the [[Retro Vision]] pill effect.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} now resets the game's timer when used.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed [[Lazarus]] and [[Lilith]]'s visuals being overridden.

